' Autor: Matija Krivec
' Verzija 1.0
' Dijagram prikazuje dobivanje događaja do Home Page-a
@startuml

title get events

skinparam maxMessageSize 150
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ArrowColor #212529

skinparam sequence {
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #E7F1FF
    ParticipantBorderColor #0D6EFD
    ActorBackgroundColor #F8F9FA
    ActorBorderColor #212529
    LifeLineBorderColor #212529
}

actor User
participant WebSucelje
participant Backend
database Database
participant TicketmasterAPI

User -> WebSucelje: Open Home Page
activate WebSucelje
WebSucelje -> Backend: GET api/events/
activate Backend

ref over Backend, TicketmasterAPI, Database
   Keep ticketmaster events up to date
end ref

opt HTTP error during up to date
   Backend-->WebSucelje: Error
   WebSucelje-->User: Show Error
else no error

Backend --> Database: get events
activate Database
Database --> Backend: events data
deactivate Database

Backend--> WebSucelje: events data
deactivate Backend

WebSucelje-->User: Load Events on Page
end
@enduml